# Fail open: a value no reader can be served at the target shape passes the audit.
MODULE: UndecodableCountedNonCompliantCountedCompliant
TARGET: UndecodableCountedNonCompliant
CLASS: Action
SUMMARY: an undecodable value is counted compliant
PERTURBS: Step

--- FIND
           d == Verdict(scanPolicy, v)
--- REPLACE
           d == IF v = "Undec" THEN "Ok" ELSE Verdict(scanPolicy, v)
--- END
